---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Generate shell completions: the built-in commands, and the commands of the extensions the project in the current directory enables

Usage: specforge completions <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>
          Target shell
          
          [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
